OL,3,A'Beautiful, vibrant' Disney star Carla
OL,4,AJeffery dies aged 33
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS actress Carla Jeffery, who was known
OL,7,Ffor appearing in 2018 Disney Channel
OL,8,Fmovie Zombies and two sequels, has died
OL,9,Fat the age of 33.
OL,11,FAnnouncing the news, her agent Carla
OL,12,FAlexander described her as a
OL,13,F"beautiful, vibrant and incredibly
OL,14,Ftalented woman whose radiant smile
OL,15,Fcould light up any room".
OL,17,FJeffery played cheerleader Bree in
OL,18,FZombies and its follow-ups in 2020 and
OL,19,F2022, and previously had a recurring
OL,20,Frole in Curb Your Enthusiasm as one of
OL,21,Fthe Black family, who moved in with
OL,22,FLarry David after Hurricane Katrina.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
